@template warm
// ZW1 (writer), patch 0.92.3 item 26: crew comment when you wear dirty clothes. clothes.remark: yesterday's clothes
// (flag:clothes.stale); clothes.grubby: a grubby uniform (flag:clothes.grubby, AC3). Bubbles, 60 characters or fewer.
// Kind, never mean: the joke is on the clothes, not on you.
== clothes.remark
? flag:clothes.stale
- Yesterday's clothes, pet? Busy day? Change when you can.
- Oh, you've not had time to change. Never mind.
? flag:clothes.stale tier>=friend
- Get a fresh shirt on, then come and sit with me.   #warm
== clothes.grubby
? flag:clothes.grubby
- Look at you, all grimy. Hard day? Go and change.
- Oh dear, you've brought half the machine with you.   #funny
? flag:clothes.grubby tier>=friend
- Change and wash, then I want to hear all about it.   #warm
